    "text": "To view keyboard shortcuts, press question mark\nView keyboard shortcuts\nHome\nExplore\nNotifications\nFollow\nChat\nGrok\nPremium\nHistory\nProfile\nMore\nPost\nKyle\n@kylecodex1\nPost\nSee new posts\nConversation\nWins MKT\n@WinsMkt\n(1/3) I started playing TA more than 2 years ago in Daisy Hills R. Back then I could barely get a 1:22. One day out of nowhere 🇯🇵\n@tomegome_g\n found a completely new strategy to NISC the famous ramp turn. It was mindblowing.. 🤯 and is still today’s standard route used in mogis!\n3:56 AM · May 12, 2022\n1\n9\nPost your reply\n\n\nReply\nWins MKT\n@WinsMkt\n·\nMay 12, 2022\n(2/3) Me and \n@Kazuo_MK\n would play this track together for many hours - trying to get better everytime. Then another 🇯🇵 player called @_Nu11Nu11 took all strats and improved them to get the first 1:20. Insane sub for that moment in time and still a big challenge for players today!\n1\n6\nWins MKT\n@WinsMkt\n·\nMay 12, 2022\n(3/3) This is the video of the route I used today, it’s the current world record and my best run so far: 1:20.21 (40.11/40.10). I hope someone can take this route and perfect it to set a legendary 1:19. Good luck all! 🙏😘🔥\n1\n19\nRelevant people\nWins MKT\n@WinsMkt\nFollow\n🇳🇱 MKT-Nickname: Wins / Clan: Antumbra / TA WRs Holder / Team WOR\nTrending now\nWhat’s happening\nSports · Trending\nRod Woodson\nPolitics · Trending\nGorsuch\nTrending in United States\nPall Mall\nTrending in California\n#WONYOUNG\nShow more\nTerms\n ·\nPrivacy\n ·\nCookies\n ·\nAccessibility\n ·\nUS TIDA\n ·\nAds Info\n ·\nMore\n© 2026 X Corp.",
